  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups sifted all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "1 cup butter, melted",
    "4 eggs",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "½ teaspoon salt",
    "0.625 cup lemon juice",
    "1 tablespoon finely grated lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a 9x13-inch baking pan with parchment paper, leaving an overhang for easy removal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/57sobj8bPAfHrXjg2RynZCYrZzU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-01-4a18d530082c4d539dea5644fc111fc1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir 2 ¼ cups flour and confectioners’ sugar together in a medium bowl; blend in cooled melted butter until dough is crumbly but holds together when pressed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YKS2pBaZEpb_pyaPz1TqKj5p3qU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-02-79e717ad4dc44ca4b74cead4ae7dfa64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press mixture evenly into the prepared pan. Bake until golden and set, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ui2kdiJz5ZX-ZB8BDHhwk0GYoFI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-03-a62d14b01ea24267b808062978c3ebda.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, whisk eggs in a large bowl until pale and frothy. Combine white sugar, baking powder, ¼ cup flour, and salt in a separate bowl; stir sugar mixture into eggs until smooth. Whisk in lemon juice and zest until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J1RN-IsEj9VGkNWl9ZsiZXIv5kc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-04-eb9e3fcc609e45558370d3fcc548b57b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour filling over hot crust. Bake in the preheated oven until center is just set and no longer jiggly, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lIXZmRYWiSresF6D-88I1Ja5gWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-05-194581e41e97421795df9b4e6f354e5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool completely in the pan on a wire rack. Use parchment overhang to lift bars from pan before cutting into squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p7vQIyw57SYJC6EpMYmgT6XUiu4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-step-06-9453467d904449a48421a1397ed264a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xyza93JZLc8zxw40KRyhM7KKNKo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25091-lemon-square-bars-VAT-Beauty-4x3-038bb7da2a224f9d8edf5aad38cda05d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25091/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
